{"format":"paperden","version":1,"mode":"write","title":"Project Development Log","theme":"carbon","pages":[{"design":"carbon","footerLeft":"","footerRight":"","headerRight":"","headerRightHtml":" ","html":"<div class=\"concept-layout log-cover\"><p class=\"concept-slot slot-carbon-cover-0\" data-fit=\"true\"><br></p><h1 class=\"concept-slot slot-carbon-cover-1\" data-fit=\"true\">Project<br>development log.</h1><p class=\"concept-slot slot-carbon-cover-2\" data-fit=\"true\">PROJECT TITLE</p><p class=\"concept-slot slot-carbon-cover-3\" data-fit=\"true\">Design and Evaluation of an Adaptive Multi-Model Orchestration System for Heterogeneous LLM Workloads</p><p class=\"concept-slot slot-carbon-cover-7\" data-fit=\"true\"><br></p><p class=\"concept-slot slot-carbon-cover-8\" data-fit=\"true\">AUTHOR</p><p class=\"concept-slot slot-carbon-cover-9\" data-fit=\"true\">John Gambino</p><p class=\"concept-slot slot-carbon-cover-10\" data-fit=\"true\">ACADEMIC YEAR</p><p class=\"concept-slot slot-carbon-cover-11\" data-fit=\"true\">2026-2027</p><p class=\"concept-slot slot-carbon-cover-12\" data-fit=\"true\">LOG STARTED</p><p class=\"concept-slot slot-carbon-cover-13\" data-fit=\"true\">10 October 2026</p></div>","id":"carbon-log-title","label":"FYP / DEVELOPMENT LOG","layout":"concept-cover","footerLeftHtml":" ","footerRightHtml":" ","footerRule":false},{"footerLeft":"JOHN GAMBINO","footerRight":"02","headerRight":"TAG KEY","html":"<p class=\"template-label\" style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">00 / HOW TO READ THIS LOG</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th style=\"width: 23%;\">ENTRY ID</th><th style=\"width: 23%;\">CATEGORY</th><th style=\"width: 54%;\">USE CASE</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color: rgb(241, 155, 91); font-family: Consolas;\"><b>BUG-001</b></td><td><b>Bugs</b></td><td>Recording any errors, what fixed them, and subsequent tests to prevent replication (if applicable). Dedicated bugfix tests may have a linked TEST entry.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color: rgb(241, 155, 91); font-family: Consolas;\"><b>FEAT-001</b></td><td><b>Features</b></td><td>New feature added to the application.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color: rgb(241, 155, 91); font-family: Consolas;\"><b>TEST-001</b></td><td><b>Testing</b></td><td>Manual and code based testing of the application, either partial or full.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color: rgb(241, 155, 91); font-family: Consolas;\"><b>EXP-001</b></td><td><b>Experiments</b></td><td>Conducting experiments (eg. A/B testing) to progress the application, or to compare against existing methods.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color: rgb(241, 155, 91); font-family: Consolas;\"><b>RX-001</b></td><td><b>Research</b></td><td>References and information garnered from research papers and other academic sources used in development, or how they have impacted my development.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color: rgb(241, 155, 91); font-family: Consolas;\"><b>DOC-001</b></td><td><b>Documentation</b></td><td>Any documentation supplied with the application, excluding this project log.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color: rgb(241, 155, 91); font-family: Consolas;\"><b>DEC-001</b></td><td><b>Decisions</b></td><td>Decisions made when multiple options are present, usually proceeding experiments. Includes reasoning behind the decisions.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color: rgb(241, 155, 91); font-family: Consolas;\"><b>PLAN-001</b></td><td><b>Planning</b></td><td>Any general idea brainstorming, or amendments made to project scope.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 16pt;\"><br></h2>","id":"carbon-log-intro","label":"FYP / PROJECT LOG","footerLeftHtml":"JOHN GAMBINO"}],"sources":[],"typography":{"body":"Corbel","heading":"Arial","label":"Consolas"},"edition":"v1.3","otherWorkspace":{"mode":"pdf","edition":"v0.1","pages":[],"sources":[],"theme":"field","title":"My PDF","typography":{}}}